---
description: Decide field-level findings for recoverContinuity.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: When cast, props, or audience paths change, propose bounded in-character recovery material and feasible scene adjustments. Preserve revealed facts and participant boundaries, obtain stage-manager approval, and log the actual path for subsequent scenes and post-show reset. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
